avy\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:navy\">Australian Government Higher Education Provider Number CRICOS #00212K </span><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:navy\">NOTICE &amp; DISCLAIMER: This email and any files transmitted with it may contain\r\n<br>\r\nconfidential or copyright material and are for the attention of the addressee <br>\r\nonly. If you have received this email in error please notify us by email <br>\r\nreply and delete it from your system. The University of Canberra accepts <br>\r\nno liability for any damage caused by any virus transmitted by this email.</span><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:navy\">==============================================================================<u></u><u></u></span></p></div></div>"
