     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\">Hi Bernd,<br>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\nIt returned half the loci, is the loci in order of &quot;most&quot; outlying? I wish to then blast them<br>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\nThanks,<br>\r\n\r\nRobert<br>\r\n\r\n</span></font></div>"
