&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#1f497d\"></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:navy\">NOTICE &amp; DISCLAIMER: This email and any files transmitted with it may contain\r\n<br>\r\nconfidential or copyright material and are for the attention of the addressee <br>\r\nonly. If you have received this email in error please notify us by email <br>\r\nreply and delete it from your system. The University of Canberra accepts <br>\r\nno liability for any damage caused by any virus transmitted by this email.</span><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#1f497d\"></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:navy\">==============================================================================</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-US\">From:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-US\"> <a rel=\"nofollow\">da...@googlegroups.com</a> [mailto:<a rel=\"nofollow\">da...@googlegroups.com</a>]\r\n<b>On Behalf Of </b>Robert O<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Saturday, 2 February 2019 11:52<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> dartR &lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">da...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> [dartR] Identifying outlying loci</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> </p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hi Everyone,</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">I am trying to identify the outlying loci in my SNP data. I have used gl.outflank(gi, plot=True), which identified 10 loci with High Fst (below). Is there away to get the names of those 10 loci ?</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<pre style=\"line-height:11.25pt;background:black;word-break:break-all;white-space:pre-wrap;outline:currentcolor none medium;word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:#dedede;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">$outflank$numberHighFstOutliers</span></pre>\r\n<pre style=\"line-height:11.25pt;background:black;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:#dedede;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm\">[1] 10</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:#dedede\"></span></pre>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Thanks heaps!</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Robert</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;dartR&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to\r\n<a rel=\"nofollow\">dartr+un...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nVisit this group at <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/group/dartr\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/group/dartr&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792459412000000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2AjUJcqzWSh_f8d7J97ion\">https://groups.google.com/group/dartr</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792459412000000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3VCtKDhFIGcQO0E3hr2uNi\">https://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</blockquote></div>"
