;color:#1f497d\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:navy\">==============================================================================<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">From:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">da...@googlegroups.com</a> [mailto:<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">da...@googlegroups.com</a>]\r\n<b>On Behalf Of </b>Robert O<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Tuesday, 5 February 2019 10:06<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> dartR &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">da...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> Re: [dartR] Identifying outlying loci<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Hi Bernd,<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nIt returned half the loci, is the loci in order of &quot;most&quot; outlying? I wish to then blast them<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nThanks,<br>\r\nRobert<br>\r\n</span><br>\r\n<br>\r\nOn Monday, February 4, 2019 at 10:10:46 AM UTC+10:30, Bernd. Gruber wrote:<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<blockquote style=\"border:none;border-left:solid #cccccc 1.0pt;padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 6.0pt;margin-left:4.8pt;margin-right:0cm\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Hi Robert,</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"> </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">If you run you command via:</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"> </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">out &lt;- gl.outflank(<a href=\"http://possums.gl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://possums.gl&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792459412012000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0GFcmYHD6RoxNRimhrPYGm\">possums.gl</a>)</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"> </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">then the\r\n</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"> </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">out$index that is returned has the information you need. This object is true if the snp is an outlier\r\n according to outflank.</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"> </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">So simply</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"> </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">locNames(<a href=\"http://possums.gl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://possums.gl&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792459412012000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0GFcmYHD6RoxNRimhrPYGm\">possums.gl</a>)[out$index]</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"> </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">should give you the names of the loci.</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"> </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Cheers, Bernd</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"> </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"> </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"> </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:navy\">==============================================================================</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:navy\">Dr Bernd Gruber\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:navy\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#1f497d\">                                            )/_         \r\n</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#1f497d\">                                                         _.--..---&